

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### GET - Revisar estado del server
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health HTTP/1.1
Accept: application/json


### GET - Obtener info del sistema
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/info HTTP/1.1

### GET - Obtener tareas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tasks HTTP/1.1


### GET - Ruta innexistente
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/no-existe HTTP/1.1